<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47598" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡρῷον</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡρωο-ώϊον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερόν</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕδος</span>) <i>shrine of a hero</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.17
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θἠρῷον</span>, i.e.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἡρῷον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				819
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>tomb,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12(7).478
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				4.799
			</span></i> (Apamea, <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>), etc.:—in form
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡρώειον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				4418
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cilicia</span>), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτρον</span>) <i>hexameter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Num.</u>
				4
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡρῷα</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερά</span>), τά, <i>festival of
				a hero</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δειπνεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.811d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.974
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
